{"task_id": "Mbpp/14", "solution": "def find_Volume(height: float, baseA: float, baseB: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculate the volume of a right-angled triangular prism.\n    Delegates calculation to an internal TriangularPrism class.\n    \"\"\"\n    class TriangularPrism:\n        \"\"\"Encapsulates the data and calculation logic for a triangular prism.\"\"\"\n        def __init__(self, height: float, baseA: float, baseB: float):\n            self._height = height\n            self._baseA = baseA\n            self._baseB = baseB\n\n        def compute_area(self) -> float:\n            \"\"\"Computes the area of the triangular base.\"\"\"\n            return 0.5 * self._baseA * self._baseB\n\n        def compute_volume(self) -> float:\n            \"\"\"Computes the volume of the prism.\"\"\"\n            base_area = self.compute_area()\n            return self._height * base_area\n\n    prism = TriangularPrism(height, baseA, baseB)\n    return prism.compute_volume()"}
