{"task_id": "Mbpp/61", "solution": "def count_Substrings(input_str: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts substrings where the sum of digits equals the substring's length.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(input_str)\n    count = 0\n\n    for start in range(n):\n        digit_sum = 0\n        for end in range(start, n):\n            # Convert character to integer and add to sum\n            digit_sum += int(input_str[end])\n            # Calculate the length of the current substring\n            length = end - start + 1\n            # Check if sum of digits equals length\n            if digit_sum == length:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
