{"task_id": "Mbpp/65", "solution": "def recursive_list_sum(nested_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Flattens a nested list of integers and returns their sum.\n    Raises TypeError if any element is not an integer or a list.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(nested_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n\n    flattened_numbers = []\n\n    def _flatten_and_collect(element):\n        if isinstance(element, list):\n            for item in element:\n                _flatten_and_collect(item)\n        elif isinstance(element, int):\n            flattened_numbers.append(element)\n        else:\n            raise TypeError(f\"List can only contain integers or other lists, found type: {type(element).__name__}\")\n\n    _flatten_and_collect(nested_list)\n    return sum(flattened_numbers)"}
