{"task_id": "Mbpp/308", "solution": "from typing import List\n\ndef large_product(list1: List[int], list2: List[int], k: int) -> List[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the k largest products from two lists, selecting one factor from each.\n    Generates all pairwise products, sorts them, and returns the top k.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_products = [x * y for x in list1 for y in list2]\n    all_products.sort(reverse=True)\n    return all_products[:k]"}
