{"task_id": "Mbpp/306", "solution": "def max_sum_increasing_subseq(array: list[int], n: int, i: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum sum of an increasing subsequence ending with array[k],\n    where preceding elements are from array[0...i].\n    \"\"\"\n    dp = [0] * (i + 1)\n\n    for current_idx in range(i + 1):\n        dp[current_idx] = array[current_idx]\n        for prev_idx in range(current_idx):\n            if array[current_idx] > array[prev_idx]:\n                dp[current_idx] = max(dp[current_idx], dp[prev_idx] + array[current_idx])\n\n    max_prefix_sum = 0\n    for j in range(i + 1):\n        if array[k] > array[j]:\n            max_prefix_sum = max(max_prefix_sum, dp[j])\n\n    return max_prefix_sum + array[k]"}
