{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "def find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th Lucas number using an iterative approach.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize with the first two Lucas numbers L(0) and L(1)\n    a, b = 2, 1  # a = L(i-2), b = L(i-1)\n\n    # Iteratively calculate Lucas numbers up to n\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        next_lucas = a + b\n        a = b\n        b = next_lucas\n    return b"}
