{"task_id": "Mbpp/415", "solution": "def max_Product(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds a pair of integers with the highest product from a given array.\n    Raises ValueError if the array has fewer than two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(array) < 2:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input array must contain at least two integers.\")\n\n    max_prod = float('-inf')\n    result_pair = (None, None)\n\n    for i in range(len(array)):\n        for j in range(i + 1, len(array)):\n            prod = array[i] * array[j]\n            if prod > max_prod:\n                max_prod = prod\n                result_pair = (array[i], array[j])\n\n    return tuple(sorted(result_pair))"}
