{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is given by (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_of_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    average = sum_of_cubes / n\n    return float(average)"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the cube sum of the first n even natural numbers using a closed-form formula.\n    Raises ValueError if n is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be a positive integer\")\n\n    # The sum of cubes of the first n even natural numbers is 8 times the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    # The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    sum_of_first_n_naturals = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    result = 8 * (sum_of_first_n_naturals ** 2)\n    return result"}
