{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "from math import isqrt\n\ndef sumofFactors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all even factors of the given number n.\n    Returns 0 if n has no even factors or if n is non-positive.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n\n    even_factors = set()\n\n    for d in range(1, isqrt(n) + 1):\n        if n % d == 0:\n            if d % 2 == 0:\n                even_factors.add(d)\n            \n            other = n // d\n            if other % 2 == 0:\n                even_factors.add(other)\n                \n    return sum(even_factors)"}
