{"task_id": "Mbpp/478", "solution": "def remove_lowercase(input_string):\n    \"\"\"\n    Removes all contiguous lowercase substrings from the given string.\n    Processes the string character by character, appending non-lowercase characters or\n    sequences of non-lowercase characters to the result.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    i = 0\n    n = len(input_string)\n    while i < n:\n        if 'a' <= input_string[i] <= 'z':\n            # Skip all consecutive lowercase characters\n            while i < n and 'a' <= input_string[i] <= 'z':\n                i += 1\n        else:\n            # Append uppercase or non-alphabetic characters\n            result.append(input_string[i])\n            i += 1\n    return \"\".join(result)"}
