{"task_id": "Mbpp/615", "solution": "def average_tuple(data: tuple[tuple[float, ...], ...]) -> list[float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average value for each inner tuple within a tuple of tuples.\n    Returns a list containing the average of each inner tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    averages = []\n    for inner_tuple in data:\n        # Calculate the sum and count of elements for the current inner tuple.\n        # It's assumed inner_tuple is not empty as per design context (FR3) and constraints.\n        average_value = sum(inner_tuple) / len(inner_tuple)\n        averages.append(average_value)\n    return averages"}
