{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "import math\n\ndef lateralsurface_cone(r: float, h: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Compute the lateral surface area of a right circular cone given radius r and height h.\n    Raises ValueError if r or h are not positive numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    if r <= 0 or h <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Radius and height must be positive numbers.\")\n\n    slant_height = math.sqrt(r**2 + h**2)\n    lateral_area = math.pi * r * slant_height\n    return lateral_area"}
