{"task_id": "Mbpp/765", "solution": "def find_nth_polite_number(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the nth polite number.\n    A polite number is a positive integer that can be expressed as the sum of two or more consecutive positive integers,\n    which is equivalent to any positive integer that is not a power of two.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    num = 1\n    while True:\n        # A number 'x' is a power of 2 if x > 0 and (x & (x - 1)) == 0.\n        # If 'num' is NOT a power of 2, it is a polite number.\n        if not (num > 0 and (num & (num - 1)) == 0):\n            count += 1\n            if count == n:\n                return num\n        num += 1"}
