{"task_id": "Mbpp/791", "solution": "def remove_nested(input_tuple: Tuple[Any, ...]) -> Tuple[Any, ...]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Recursively removes all nested tuples from the input tuple.\n    Returns a new tuple containing only non-tuple elements, preserving order.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    stack = [iter(input_tuple)]\n\n    while stack:\n        try:\n            element = next(stack[-1])\n            if isinstance(element, tuple):\n                stack.append(iter(element))  # Push nested tuple onto stack\n            else:\n                result.append(element)\n        except StopIteration:\n            stack.pop()\n\n    return tuple(result)"}
