{"task_id": "Mbpp/806", "solution": "def max_run_uppercase(input_str: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the maximum run of uppercase characters in the given string.\n    Only 'A' through 'Z' are considered uppercase.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_run_length = 0\n    current_run_length = 0\n    for char in input_str:\n        if 'A' <= char <= 'Z':\n            current_run_length += 1\n        else:\n            current_run_length = 0\n        max_run_length = max(max_run_length, current_run_length)\n    return max_run_length"}
