{"task_id": "Mbpp/473", "solution": "def tuple_intersection(list1, list2):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the intersection of tuples in two lists, treating tuples as unordered sets of elements.\n    It normalizes tuples by sorting their elements before finding the common elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    normalized_set1 = {tuple(sorted(t)) for t in list1}\n    normalized_set2 = {tuple(sorted(t)) for t in list2}\n    return normalized_set1.intersection(normalized_set2)"}
